'''Tranylcypromine''', sold under the brand name '''Parnate''' among others, is a [[MAOI|monoamine oxidase inhibitor]] (MAOI). More specifically, tranylcypromine acts as nonselective and irreversible inhibitor of the enzyme monoamine oxidase (MAO). It is used as an [[antidepressant]]<nowiki/>and [[anxiolytic]] agent in the clinical treatment of mood and anxiety disorders, respectively. It is also effective in the treatment of ADHD.

